### The update check: a newer release found, shown in the menu bar and in About.

## Update available

# Item in the menu bar menu when a newer release is out; it opens that release's page. $version is the release, such as 2.1.0.
update-menu-available = Update Available: { $version }…
# Button in About when a newer release is out; it opens that release's page in the browser.
update-open-release = Open Release Page
